AWS CLOUDTCH:-
  amzon cloudwatch is a monitoring and observalibility services in aws that helps you monitor aws resources & application.
cloudwatch is used to monitor , log , alert & automate actions for aws resources & applications
cloudwatch performance operational dta in form of logs & matrix as a single source of truth collecting diffrent sources.
cloudwatch uses alaram to take automate action
cloudwatch provide upto 1 sec visibiltity of matrix & logs of data.
cloudwatch collect & visualize the real time logs , matrix , & even data .
cloudwatch visulize performance data , create alarms & core releated data to performance issue.

USES OF CLOUDWATCH:-
     1) monitor performance resource
     2) collect & analyze logs
     3) create alarms
     4) support autoscaling
     5) application monitoring
     6) create dashboard


EXAMPLE:-
     if an ec2 instance cpu utilization rises 80% above cloudwatch can:-
           . trigger an alarm.
           . send an SNS  notification.
           . launch additional ec2 instance through autoscaling.



